# NorthCrest Dairy — Warehouse Operations & Profitability Analysis

**Tools:** Microsoft Excel · Power Query · Microsoft Power BI  
**Period:** January 2023 – December 2025  
**Analyst:** Maj Okrikri

---

## Project Overview

This project takes three years of raw warehouse data from a Canadian dairy producer and turns it into two audience-specific Power BI dashboards — one for senior leadership and one for the warehouse operations team.

The dataset covers 2,500 orders, 22 product SKUs, 36 months of inventory records, and shipment performance data across three Canadian regions (Western, Central, and Atlantic) and three sales channels (Retail, Foodservice, and Industrial).
